
  tray — a task tracker in two layers any key to go back
  
  Dump any task, or a half-thought, into the garage for   
  the month you expect to pick it up. Take it onto the    
  tray when you are ready to work on it.                  
  
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  keys                  acting             in review      
  ↑↓  j k move          a       add        R       restore
  tab     switch layer  t       take       E       erase  
  space   select        r       rewrite    v/esc   leave  
  enter   act           x       done                      
  /       filter        d       hand back                 
  v       review        >       move to                   
